<title>SINGAPORE: Osprey unit sells vessel for US$9.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Osprey unit sells vessel for US$9.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osprey Maritime Ltd said on Thursday its 51-percent owned subsidiary, Osprey Sky Pte Ltd, had agreed to sell a vessel for US$9.9 million.</p>
<p>The sale is for the vessel &quot;M.T. Osprey Sky&quot;, a company statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
</text>
